The C files in this directory contain functions, type definitions, and
configuration values taken from NASA's Core Flight System (cFS):

    https://github.com/nasa/cFE  (Core Flight Executive)
    modules/time/fsw/src/cfe_time_api.c
    modules/core_api/fsw/inc/cfe_time_api_typedefs.h
    modules/time/fsw/src/cfe_time_utils.h

    https://github.com/nasa/LC   (Limit Checker application)
    config/default_lc_tblstruct.h        (LC_WRTEntry_t results-table entry)
    fsw/inc/lc_interface_cfg.h           (LC_MAX_WATCHPOINTS default, 176)
    fsw/src/lc_watch.c                   (the LC_OperData.WRTPtr[WatchIndex] write pattern)

Copied functions are delimited in each file between "verbatim from …" and
"end …" markers. lc_watch_result_bounds.c uses LC's results-table entry type
and table size, with accessor functions written for this project that model
LC's guarded, indexed table writes. Everything outside the copied portions
(the verification harnesses) is original to this project.

